000200 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000300 PROGRAM-ID.     TRPTADJ.
000400 AUTHOR.         C HILLES.
000500 DATE-WRITTEN.   JULY, 1982.
000600*REMARKS.        THIS PROGRAM PRODUCES A REPORT WHICH SHOWS ALL
000700*                ADJUSTMENTS MADE ON THE DAY THE REPORT IS RUN.
000800*
000900*                ADDED INTERNATIONAL DATE ROUTINR "TDATECHK"
001000*                ON MAY 21, 1985.   V.W.D.
001100*
001200*    ON JUNE 9, 1985, CHANGED THIS PROGRAM IN ORDER TO
001300*    ELIMINATE THE OLD MODE PROGRAM "TR17MODE", WHICH WAS IN
001400*    "DEL".  THIS PROGRAM IS CHANGED TO USE THE "TRSCREEN"
001500*    MODE PROGRAM TO SELECT REPORT OPTIONS, AND THUS DOES AN
001600*    "ACCEPT" FROM THE JOB STREAM RATHER THAN READING A FILE
001700*    TO GET THE OPTIONS.  ALSO ADDED "THDPRT2" TO PRINT A
001800*    REPORT HEADER AND ROUTING DATA PASSED FROM "TRSCREEN".
001900*    CIH.
002000*
      *C  JUNE 23, 1994   CR KALMAN
      *C   ADDED CALL TO COBOL ERROR HANDLER -MCXCBLERR.
      *C
      *C 09/13/96  JEFF BUNGO
      *C   EXPAND DATE FIELDS FOR YEAR 2000 COMPLIANCE.
      *C   RECOMPILE TO PICK UP COPYLIB CHANGES.
      *C
      *C 02/19/97  JIM COFFMAN
      *C   ADDED LOGIC TO PRINT THE AVERAGE COST PER VERBAL REQUEST
      *C   FROM GERALD BRYANT IN DANVILLE.
      *C
      *C 09/12/97  JEFF BUNGO
      *C   REMOVED THE LOGIC TO COMBINE ADJUSTMENTS OF CODES.  THIS
      *C   COMBINATION WAS GIVING CONFUSING AND INACCURATE INFORMATION.
      *C   NOW EACH ADJUSTMENT FOR A CODE WILL BE REPORTED WITH NO
      *C   COMBINATIONS.
      *C
      *C 08OCT1997  DAVE PLUM
      *C   REVISED TO HANDLE THE SITUATION WHERE THE DDAILYTC FILE IS
      *C   EMPTY WHEN THIS PROGRAM IS EXECUTED.  PRIOR TO THIS CHANGE
      *C   THE START ON DDAILYTC WOULD RESULT IN TBLOWUP BEING CALLED.
      *C
      *C 11/17/1997  CA YODER
      *C   ADDED A TOTAL FIELD FOR THE TRANSACTION VALUE COLUMN.
      *C   JIM THOMAS REQUESTED THIS CHANGE.
      *C
      *C 19JAN1998  DAVE PLUM
      *C   REVISED TO HANDLE THE SITUATION WHERE AN INVALID SORT OPTION
      *C   IS SPECIFIED.  DEFAULT TO SORT OPTION 1 INSTEAD OF BLOWING UP.
      *C
      *C JANUARY 29, 1998, JEFF BUNGO
      *C   ADDED A NEW REPORT TOTAL OF "CODES ADJUSTED AS PERCENTAGE OF
      *C   TOTAL CODES INVENTORIED (ALL 332 TRANS, INCLUDING ADJ OF 0).
      *C
      *C 04/27/00  JIM COFFMAN
      *C   ADD CHANGES TO HANDLE A PROBLEM UNCOVERED IN THE
      *C   PHILIPPINES WHEREBY THE COST FIELD WAS BEING TRUNCATED
      *C   DUE TO THE BIG AVERAGE COST FIELD NOT BEING USED AS
      *C   IT IS IN TDCLYAB2 TO CALCULATE VALUE.
      *C
      *C 12/08/04  CA YODER    REQUEST #2004-84029
      *C   CHANGED THE WORDING ON ONE TOTAL LINE AND ADDED TWO
      *C   MORE TOTAL LINES AT THE END OF THE REPORT.
      *C
002100 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
002200 CONFIGURATION SECTION.
002300 SOURCE-COMPUTER.
002400 OBJECT-COMPUTER.
002500 SPECIAL-NAMES. C01 IS NEW-PAGE.
