           05  FILLER               PIC X(81).
014100
039600 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING HD-ROUTE-DATA, R17-REC.
039700 1-HOUSEKEEP SECTION.
039800 1-BEGIN-HOUSEKEEP.
9406CK     MOVE "C" TO SCOPE.
