           MOVE ZERO TO LINE-K, PAGE-K, TOTAL-CODES-ADJUSTED,
             TOTAL-CODES, TOTAL-ADJUSTMENT-UNITS,
             TOTAL-PREV-UNITS, TOTAL-NEW-UNITS,
             TOTAL-PERCT-ADJ, TOTAL-ADJ-COST, TOTAL-VALUE,
             TOTAL-STRM-VALUE, TOTAL-PREV-VALUE.
