042300
042400     MOVE HD-SPOOLER-NUMBER TO SPOOL-PRT.
042500**************************************************************
042600**   DATA IN THE JOB STREAM TELLS US WHETHER TO GO TO       **
042700**   DDAILYTC OR TO A FILE FOR TRANSACTION DATA.  IF FILE   **
042800**   IS CHOSEN, THE JOB WILL DETERMINE WHICH ABSTFILE THRU  **
042900**   THE USE OF A FILE COMMAND :FILE ADJFILE=ABSTFILx       **
043000**************************************************************
043100
043200     IF DDAILY-OR-FILE = "D" OR "F"
043300         NEXT SENTENCE
043400     ELSE
