059100*          STATUS-AREA ALL-ITEM-LIST BUF-MSTORERM ST-CODE-ARG
               MOVE ST-CODE-ARG TO CORPCDE OF MSTORERM-REC-I
               READ MSTORERM-I INTO BUF-MSTORERM
                   INVALID KEY MOVE 17 TO COND-WORD
               END-READ
059200         IF STR-CLASS = R17-CLASS-1 OR R17-CLASS-2 OR R17-CLASS-3
059300                                    OR R17-CLASS-4 OR R17-CLASS-5
059400              NEXT SENTENCE
059500         ELSE
059600              GO TO 7-READ-ADJ-FILE.

           ADD 1 TO TOTAL-CODES-INVENTORIED.

           IF ADJ-QTY = 0
               GO TO 7-READ-ADJ-FILE.
059700
059800     MOVE ADJ-CODE        TO SORT-CODE.
059900     MOVE ADJ-DATE        TO SORT-DATE.
060000     MOVE ADJ-TIME        TO SORT-TIME.
060100     MOVE ADJ-CHRG        TO SORT-CHARGED.
060200     MOVE ADJ-QTY         TO SORT-ADJ-QTY.
060300     MOVE ADJ-QTY         TO SORT-ADJ-QTY-UNSIGNED.
060400     MOVE ADJ-AVG-COST-BIG  TO SORT-AVG-COST.
060500     MOVE ADJ-UM          TO SORT-UM.
060600     MOVE ADJ-ONHAND      TO SORT-ONHAND.
060700
060800     SUBTRACT SORT-ADJ-QTY FROM SORT-ONHAND
060900        GIVING HOLD-PREV-QTY.
061000     MOVE HOLD-PREV-QTY       TO SORT-PREV-QTY.
           DISPLAY "SORT-PERCT-ADJ:  " SORT-PERCT-ADJ.
061100
061200 7-CONTINUE.
061300     RELEASE SORT-REC.
061400
061500     GO TO 7-READ-ADJ-FILE.
061600
061700 7-RA-X.
061800     EXIT.
061900
062000 7-COMBINE-CODES SECTION.
       7-COMBINE-CODES-PARA.
